    "A MAC address is what gets blocked." : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value"
    },
    "A MAC address is what the reservation matches on." : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value"
    },
    "A TTL is a whole number of seconds, from 0 to 2147483647." : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value"
    },
    "A blocked MAC gets no address from any server in this group. It is not a firewall rule — the device can still use a static address." : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value"
    },
    "A change window is already running. Saving replaces its message and leaves it running." : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value"
    },
    "A change window shows every user a banner and makes the server refuse changes. It can be lifted from here too — the settings path stays open while the window is running." : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value"
    },
    "A code from the web console's API Tokens page fills in the address and signs you in. Typing the address above and entering a token by hand works just as well." : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value"
    },
    "A description is worth the seconds — the next person here will be reading it." : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value"
    },
    "A device other than the recorded one was seen on these within %lld days — something is using an address IPAM gave to someone else." : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value"
    },
    "A forward record is created in this zone, and a reverse record if one is configured." : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value"
    },
    "A host name or IP address, plus a port if your control plane isn't on 443. Name it if you like — \"Lab\", \"Prod EU\"." : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value"
    },
    "A magic packet goes to %@, %@." : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value"
    },
    "A magic packet only reaches the broadcast domain it is sent into, so a machine on another subnet needs its broadcast address here." : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value"
    },
    "A passcode is weaker than biometrics here, and unlike a biometric enrolment it doesn't invalidate the stored token when it changes. Sign in again after setting up biometrics to upgrade this." : {
      "extractionState" : "extracted_with_value"
    },
    "A record needs a value." : {
